{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24084","headline":"二月一日作赠韦七庶子 · 白居易","name":"二月一日作赠韦七庶子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"园杏红萼坼，庭兰紫芽出。\n不觉春已深，今朝二月一。\n去冬病疮痏，将养遵医术。\n今春入道场，清净依僧律。\n尝闻圣贤语，所慎斋与疾。\n遂使爱酒人，停桮一百日。\n明朝二月二，疾平斋复毕。\n应须挈一壶，寻花觅韦七。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24084.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24084","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}